<section class="mt-10 md:mt-20 mb-10 lg:mb-16"><ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li><p class="m-0 text-sm text-text-secondary">
            <strong class="text-desktop-h5 font-semibold text-text-primary">100s of millions</strong>
            of daily queries (world’s largest agentic search)
          </p></li><li><p class="m-0 text-sm text-text-secondary">
            <strong class="text-desktop-h5 font-semibold text-text-primary">Ranked 1st</strong>
            in independent testing
          </p></li><li><p class="m-0 text-sm text-text-secondary">
            <strong class="text-desktop-h5 font-semibold text-text-primary">Up to 20x</strong>
            faster than other search APIs
          </p></li><li><p class="m-0 text-sm text-text-secondary">
            <strong class="text-desktop-h5 font-semibold text-text-primary">1 million&#43;</strong>
            OpenClaw &amp; Hermes sign-ups
          </p></li><li><p class="m-0 text-sm text-text-secondary">
            <strong class="text-desktop-h5 font-semibold text-text-primary">150 billion</strong>
            total queries answered
          </p></li><li><p class="m-0 text-sm text-text-secondary">
            <strong class="text-desktop-h5 font-semibold text-text-primary">Zero dependencies</strong>
            on Google or Bing
          </p></li></ul>
</section>


  <div class="layout gap-y-10 bg-black py-10 text-text-primary lg:gap-y-16 lg:py-16" data-theme="dark">
    
<section class="grid items-center lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 grid-cols-1 lg:gap-12">
  <div class="">
    <h2 class="max-lg:text-desktop-h4 md:max-lg:text-desktop-h3 lg:text-display-mobile-h2 xl:text-display-desktop-h4"><span class="font-inter">#</span>1 in independent testing</h2><div class="pt-4 text-default md:text-desktop-default [&_p+p]:pt-4 [&_a]:text-text-interactive"><p>Any benchmark can be gamed. Public ones pre-publish their questions, private ones favor the vendor running them.</p>
<p>We trust <a href="https://aimultiple.com/agentic-search" target="_blank" rel="noopener">independent evaluations</a>, where Brave ranked first for agent quality.</p>
</div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2">
      
<figure class="card card__contents m-0 flex flex-col gap-5" data-theme="light">
  <figcaption class="text-mobile-h4 sm:text-desktop-h5">Agent quality score, AIMultiple independent test</figcaption>
  <ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-col gap-3.5 p-0">
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5">
      <span class="w-24 shrink-0 font-semibold">Brave</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[12rem] flex-1 items-center gap-3">
        <span class="h-8 w-[82%] rounded-md bg-primitive-brands-rorange-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="font-semibold">14.89</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 text-text-secondary">
      <span class="w-24 shrink-0">Firecrawl</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[12rem] flex-1 items-center gap-3">
        <span class="h-8 w-[73%] rounded-md bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>14.58</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 text-text-secondary">
      <span class="w-24 shrink-0">Exa</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[12rem] flex-1 items-center gap-3">
        <span class="h-8 w-[68%] rounded-md bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>14.39</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 text-text-secondary">
      <span class="w-24 shrink-0">Tavily</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[12rem] flex-1 items-center gap-3">
        <span class="h-8 w-[47%] rounded-md bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>13.67</span>
      </span>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p class="m-0 text-[1rem] italic leading-normal text-text-primary">Axis starts at 12 to show the spread. Source: AIMultiple.</p>
</figure>

    </div></section>

    
<section class="grid items-center lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 grid-cols-1 lg:gap-12">
  <div class="lg:order-2">
    <h2 class="max-lg:text-desktop-h4 md:max-lg:text-desktop-h3 lg:text-display-mobile-h2 xl:text-display-desktop-h4">Better data beats bigger models</h2><div class="pt-4 text-default md:text-desktop-default [&_p+p]:pt-4 [&_a]:text-text-interactive"><p>In head-to-head evals, open-weights like Qwen3 and Nemotron outperform free frontier models from ChatGPT, Google AI Mode, Grok, and Perplexity.</p>
<p>The difference? Grounding with Brave&rsquo;s LLM Context API.</p>
</div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 lg:order-1">
      
<figure class="card card__contents m-0 flex flex-col gap-5 bg-neutral-10" data-theme="light">
  <figcaption>
    <span class="block text-mobile-h4 sm:text-desktop-h5">Small open models on Brave beat the frontier</span>
    <span class="text-text-primary">Blind head-to-head, Bradley-Terry Elo</span>
  </figcaption>
  <ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-col gap-3.5 p-0">
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
      <span class="w-56 shrink-0 font-semibold">Ask Brave (Nemotron 3 Ultra)</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[10rem] flex-1 items-center">
        <span class="h-1 w-[80%] bg-primitive-brands-rorange-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="-ms-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primitive-brands-rorange-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="ms-2.5 font-semibold">1,278</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
      <span class="w-56 shrink-0 font-semibold">Ask Brave v2 (Qwen3)</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[10rem] flex-1 items-center">
        <span class="h-1 w-[61.5%] bg-primitive-brands-rorange-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="-ms-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primitive-brands-rorange-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="ms-2.5 font-semibold">1,121</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-text-secondary">
      <span class="w-56 shrink-0">Grok</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[10rem] flex-1 items-center">
        <span class="h-1 w-[61%] bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="-ms-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="ms-2.5">1,115</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-text-secondary">
      <span class="w-56 shrink-0">Google AI Mode</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[10rem] flex-1 items-center">
        <span class="h-1 w-[40%] bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="-ms-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="ms-2.5">941</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-text-secondary">
      <span class="w-56 shrink-0">ChatGPT</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[10rem] flex-1 items-center">
        <span class="h-1 w-[28%] bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="-ms-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="ms-2.5">840</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-text-secondary">
      <span class="w-56 shrink-0">Perplexity</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[10rem] flex-1 items-center">
        <span class="h-1 w-[6%] bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="-ms-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="ms-2.5">652</span>
      </span>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p class="m-0 text-[1rem] italic leading-normal text-text-primary">Orange: open-weight models grounded by Brave. Gray: closed frontier products. Axis starts at 600.</p>
</figure>

    </div></section>

  </div>

  <div class="layout gap-y-10 bg-neutral-10 py-10 lg:gap-y-16 lg:py-16">
    
<section class="grid items-center lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 grid-cols-1 lg:gap-12">
  <div class="">
    <h2 class="max-lg:text-desktop-h4 md:max-lg:text-desktop-h3 lg:text-display-mobile-h2 xl:text-display-desktop-h4">Up to 20x faster (with no second hop)</h2><div class="pt-4 text-default md:text-desktop-default [&_p+p]:pt-4 [&_a]:text-text-interactive"><p>Agents make dozens of search calls per task, adding latency each time.</p>
<p>Brave delivers better data on the first call, with no pass-through to Google.</p>
</div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2">
      
<figure class="card card__contents m-0 flex flex-col gap-5" data-theme="dark">
  <figcaption class="text-mobile-h4 sm:text-desktop-h5">Average latency, AIMultiple independent test</figcaption>
  <ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-col gap-3 p-0">
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
      <span class="w-28 shrink-0 font-semibold">Brave</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[12rem] flex-1 items-center gap-3">
        <span class="h-7 w-[4%] min-w-1 rounded bg-primitive-brands-rorange-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="whitespace-nowrap font-semibold">669 ms</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-text-secondary">
      <span class="w-28 shrink-0">Tavily</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[12rem] flex-1 items-center gap-3">
        <span class="h-7 w-[6%] rounded bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="whitespace-nowrap">998 ms</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-text-secondary">
      <span class="w-28 shrink-0">Exa</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[12rem] flex-1 items-center gap-3">
        <span class="h-7 w-[6.7%] rounded bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="whitespace-nowrap">1,200 ms</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-text-secondary">
      <span class="w-28 shrink-0">Firecrawl</span>
      <span class="flex min-w-[12rem] flex-1 items-center gap-3">
        <span class="h-7 w-[7.5%] rounded bg-primitive-neutral-40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="whitespace-nowrap">1,335 ms</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-text-secondary">
      <span class="w-28 shrink-0">SerpApi</span>
